# Portal Rules

Built with @forgedevstack/bear and @forgedevstack/grid-table.
Routing via @forgedevstack/forge-compass (not react-router-dom).
All strings in i18n files (en.ts, es.ts), never hardcoded.
No pink or indigo colors. Green theme only (#22c55e, #16a34a).
Light/dark mode: code examples and text adapt automatically.
Use Bear UI components: Button, Typography, Card, Flex, Badge, Dropdown, etc.
Footer links use Button with leftIcon.
Navbar language selector uses Bear Dropdown.
Mobile responsive: Drawer for docs sidebar, responsive grids.
